# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# StartupFinance OS — Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The app runs in DEMO MODE out of the box with realistic
# sample data (no backend required). To connect a real
# Supabase backend, fill in the values below and copy this
# file to `.env.local`.

# Supabase project URL
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=

# Supabase anonymous / public key
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# App URL (used by auth redirect callbacks)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000